<div class="callout">
  <div class="callout-label">Model limitations</div>
  <div class="callout-body">Nitrogenous fertiliser (HS 3102) is Tier 2, Corroborated, in the Narrows model. Unlike crude oil and LNG, which have dedicated primary-source feeds behind them, this commodity is built from UN Comtrade bilateral pulls without an independent corroborating source layer. The dependency figures above should be read as directionally solid, not to the decimal point. The Oman correction itself is a routing fact, not a modelling assumption. Sur's geography relative to the strait is not in dispute, but the underlying trade values it is applied to carry the same estimation uncertainty as the rest of the model's fertilizer coverage.</div>
</div>

